        "h2": "Answer fast, quote faster",
        "content": "Same-day customers are usually calling or messaging several companies at once. The one that replies first with a price and a time often gets the job.\n\nMake the request easy. A form on your website with a photo field or a \"text us photos\" prompt, plus a phone number that someone actually answers during the day. Website requests land in IndustryBossPro as leads, so the person on the phone can see them right away.\n\nReply with a short text asking for photos and where the items are. Price it from the photos with a range and a time window, and send the estimate so the customer can approve it online. The [photo estimating](/blog/junk-removal/junk-removal-estimating-software) post covers how to price from pictures accurately."
